    alert register must be read to know when to process alerts for the
    TCPC. However, the interrupt signal can be used to know which port to
    check and prevent interrupts from one port causing the TCPC on another
    port from being pulled out of low power mode unecessarily.
    
    This CL adds a check of the USBC interrupt line level to know which
    TCPC to check.
    
