    Read 4: 81-1 0x31
    Read 5: 3619 0x39
    Read 6: 95-d 0x64
    Read 7: irty 0x79
    Read 7:  0x0
    Cr50 FW Version: cr50_v1.1.4781-1361995-dirty
    Read Count = 29
    Initialized TPM device CR50 revision 0
    
