    - PA6: SPI1_MISO / EC_CLAIM, output when AP is on
    - Both floating when AP off
    8 = input with pull up/down, 4 = floating input, 1 = output
    
    AP off (before this CL):
    > rw 0x40010800
    read 0x40010800 = 0x41484144
    > gpioget SPI1_NSS
      0* SPI1_NSS
